    "body": "I'm not sure what the best way to inform the user of this is, but we should note somewhere that this timeout is only advisory and doesn't have to be respected by the notification server. The `notify-rust` docs [say as much themselves](https://docs.rs/notify-rust/latest/notify_rust/struct.Notification.html#structfield.timeout), with this being the docstring for the timeout field:\r\n\r\n> Lifetime of the Notification in ms. Often not respected by server, sorry.\r\n\r\nWhere do you think the best place to put that information would be?",
    "state": "COMMENTED",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/3515#pullrequestreview-864038682",
