    "body": "I would like to grump about the fact that conversion from TOML can silently fail, resulting in fallback to a default value, without any information appearing in the logs.\r\n\r\nHowever, this design flaw is present in our other `ModuleConfig` impls as well, so it's not on @Lyndeno to fix. And this should only be an issue if someone wants their notifications to last negative time or over a month, so it's not likely to be hit in practice.\r\n\r\nOne question about the default: is there a value that you think is a better default? IIRC we were a little nervous about adding this feature originally so we kept the duration short to keep things out-of-the-way. Now that it's been proven that this is a desirable feature, maybe we should configure a more pleasant default.",
    "state": "COMMENTED",
